"What is GitHub Advanced Security?":"什么是 GitHub 高级安全？",
"GitHub Advanced Security (GHAS) encompasses GitHub’s application security products comprising GitHub Secret Protection and GitHub Code Security. GHAS adds cutting-edge tools for static analysis, software composition analysis, and secret scanning to the GitHub platform that developers already know and love. Unlike traditional application security packages that burden the software development toolchain with complex workflows that inhibit adoption, GHAS makes it easy for developers to find and fix vulnerabilities earlier in the software development life cycle.":"GitHub 高级安全 (GHAS) 涵盖 GitHub 的应用安全产品，包括 GitHub 机密保护和 GitHub 代码安全。GHAS 为开发人员早已熟悉和喜爱的 GitHub 平台增添了用于静态分析、软件成分分析和机密扫描的前沿工具。传统应用安全方案以复杂的工作流拖累软件开发工具链，阻碍推广采用；GHAS 则让开发人员能够在软件开发生命周期中更早、更轻松地发现并修复漏洞。",
"Why choose GitHub Advanced Security instead of a third-party AppSec product?":"为什么选择 GitHub 高级安全，而不是第三方 AppSec 产品？",
"Unlike third-party security add-ons, GitHub Advanced Security operates entirely in the native GitHub workflows that developers already know and love. By making it easier for developers to remediate vulnerabilities as they go, GitHub Advanced Security frees time for security teams to focus on critical strategies that protect businesses, customers, and communities from application-based vulnerabilities.":"与第三方安全附加组件不同，GitHub 高级安全完全在开发人员早已熟悉和喜爱的原生 GitHub 工作流中运行。GitHub 高级安全让开发人员能够更轻松地边开发边修复漏洞，从而为安全团队腾出时间，专注于保护企业、客户和社区免受应用漏洞威胁的关键策略。",
"What is DevSecOps?":"什么是 DevSecOps？",
"DevSecOps refers to a combination of the development, security, and operations tools necessary to develop software applications.":"DevSecOps 是指开发软件应用所需的开发、安全和运维工具的组合。",
"What is AppSec?":"什么是 AppSec？",
"Application security (AppSec) is the process of finding, fixing, and preventing security vulnerabilities in applications. GitHub Advanced Security provides AppSec tools for static application security testing (SAST), which identifies vulnerabilities in the code itself.":"应用安全 (AppSec) 是发现、修复和预防应用中安全漏洞的过程。GitHub 高级安全提供用于静态应用安全测试 (SAST) 的 AppSec 工具，可识别代码本身的漏洞。",
