"GitHub Code Security continuously scans your code as you build, helping detect vulnerabilities early, fix them fast with Copilot Autofix, and ship securely.":"GitHub 代码安全会在你构建时持续扫描代码，帮助你及早发现漏洞、借助 Copilot 自动修复快速解决，并安全地交付。",
