"Read the guide":"阅读指南",
"What is supply chain security?":"什么是供应链安全？",
"When developing a software project, you likely use other software to build and run your application, such as open-source libraries, frameworks or other tools. These resources are collectively referred to as your “dependencies”, because your project depends on them to function properly. Your project could rely on hundreds of these dependencies, forming what is known as your \"supply chain\".":"开发软件项目时，你很可能会使用其他软件来构建和运行应用，例如开源库、框架或其他工具。这些资源统称为你的“依赖项”，因为项目要依靠它们才能正常运行。你的项目可能依赖数百个这样的依赖项，从而形成所谓的“供应链”。",
"Your supply chain can pose a security risk. If one of your dependencies has a known security weakness or a bug, malicious actors could exploit this vulnerability to, for example, insert malicious code (malware), steal sensitive data, or cause some other type of disruption to your project. This type of threat is called a \"supply chain attack\". Having vulnerable dependencies in your supply chain compromises the security of your own project, and you put your users at risk, too.":"供应链可能带来安全风险。如果某个依赖项存在已知的安全弱点或缺陷，恶意行为者就可能利用该漏洞，例如插入恶意代码（恶意软件）、窃取敏感数据，或以其他方式破坏你的项目。这类威胁称为“供应链攻击”。供应链中存在有漏洞的依赖项，会危及你自己项目的安全，也会让你的用户面临风险。",
"One of the most important things you can do to protect your supply chain is to patch your vulnerable dependencies.":"保护供应链最重要的措施之一，就是为存在漏洞的依赖项打补丁。",
"Attackers don’t just target dependencies you use; they will also target user accounts and build processes as well. It’s important to secure both to ensure that the code you distribute hasn’t been tampered with.":"攻击者不只针对你使用的依赖项，还会针对用户帐户和构建流程。务必同时保护好两者，确保你分发的代码未被篡改。",
"GitHub offers a range of features to help you understand the dependencies and secure the dependencies in your environment, and to secure your GitHub accounts and build system.":"GitHub 提供一系列功能，帮助你了解并保护环境中的依赖项，以及保护你的 GitHub 帐户和构建系统。",
"GitHub offers a range of features to help you understand the dependencies and secure the dependencies in your environment, and to secure your GitHub accounts and build system":"GitHub 提供一系列功能，帮助你了解并保护环境中的依赖项，以及保护你的 GitHub 帐户和构建系统",
"Why choose GitHub’s supply chain features instead of third-party products?":"为什么选择 GitHub 的供应链功能，而不是第三方产品？",
"Unlike third-party security add-ons, GitHub’s supply chain features operate entirely in the native GitHub workflows that developers already know and love. By making it easier for developers to remediate vulnerabilities as they go, GitHub frees time for security teams to focus on critical strategies that protect businesses, customers, and communities from application-based vulnerabilities.":"与第三方安全附加组件不同，GitHub 的供应链功能完全在开发人员早已熟悉和喜爱的原生 GitHub 工作流中运行。GitHub 让开发人员能够更轻松地边开发边修复漏洞，从而为安全团队腾出时间，专注于保护企业、客户和社区免受应用漏洞威胁的关键策略。",
"What is SLSA and SLSA level 3?":"什么是 SLSA 和 SLSA 级别 3？",
"Supply-chain Levels for Software Artifacts (SLSA)":"软件产物供应链级别 (SLSA)",
"Supply-chain Levels for Software Artifacts (SLSA) is a framework for improving the end-to-end integrity of a software artifact throughout its development lifecycle.":"软件产物供应链级别 (SLSA) 是一个框架，用于在软件产物的整个开发生命周期中提升其端到端完整性。",
"It provides a comprehensive, step-by-step methodology for building integrity and provenance guarantees into your software supply chain.":"它提供一套全面、循序渐进的方法，帮助你在软件供应链中建立完整性和来源保证。",
"SLSA Level 3 signifies a significantly hardened software supply chain where builds are highly isolated, source code history is verified, and provenance is strictly controlled, providing a strong guarantee against tampering and ensuring the integrity of software artifacts.":"SLSA 级别 3 代表经过显著加固的软件供应链：构建高度隔离、源代码历史记录经过验证、来源受到严格控制，从而有力防范篡改，确保软件产物的完整性。",
"GitHub Actions and Artifact Attestations greatly simplify the journey to SLSA Level 3.":"GitHub 操作和产物证明可大大简化达到 SLSA 级别 3 的过程。",
"GitHub Actions and Artifact Attestations greatly simplify the journey to SLSA Level 3":"GitHub 操作和产物证明可大大简化达到 SLSA 级别 3 的过程",
"Can GitHub create software bill of materials or SBOMs?":"GitHub 能否创建软件物料清单 (SBOM)？",
"You can export a software bill of materials or SBOM for your repository from the GitHub dependency graph.":"你可以从 GitHub 依赖项关系图为存储库导出软件物料清单 (SBOM)。",
"SBOMs allow transparency into your open source usage and help expose supply chain vulnerabilities, reducing supply chain risks.":"SBOM 让你清楚了解开源组件的使用情况，并帮助发现供应链漏洞，降低供应链风险。",
"Are GitHub’s supply chain features paid or free?":"GitHub 的供应链功能是付费的还是免费的？",
"Most of GitHub’s supply chain features are available for free to all users.":"GitHub 的大多数供应链功能对所有用户免费开放。",
"A select few advanced features are available to private repos only in GitHub Code Security.":"少数高级功能仅在 GitHub 代码安全中面向专用存储库提供。",
"See pricing.":"查看价格。",
