"GitHub collaborates with AWS, Azure, and Google Cloud to detect secrets with high accuracy. This minimizes false positives, letting you focus on what matters.":"GitHub 与 AWS、Azure 和 Google Cloud 合作，高精度检测机密，尽量减少误报，让你专注于重要的事。",
