"A short and simple permissive license with conditions only requiring preservation of copyright and license notices. Licensed works, modifications, and larger works may be distributed under different terms and without source code.":"一种仅以保留版权和许可证声明为条件的简短宽松许可证。被许可作品、修改版本和更大的作品可以按不同条款分发且无需提供源码。",
"A permissive license whose main conditions require preservation of copyright and license notices. Contributors provide an express grant of patent rights. Licensed works, modifications, and larger works may be distributed under different terms and without source code.":"一种主要以保留版权和许可证声明为条件的宽松许可证。贡献者明确授予专利权。被许可作品、修改版本和更大的作品可以按不同条款分发且无需提供源码。",
"Permissions of this strong copyleft license are conditioned on making available complete source code of licensed works and modifications, which include larger works using a licensed work, under the same license. Copyright and license notices must be preserved. Contributors provide an express grant of patent rights.":"这种强 Copyleft 许可证的授权条件是以相同许可证公开被许可作品和修改版本的完整源码，修改版本包括使用被许可作品的更大作品。必须保留版权和许可证声明。贡献者明确授予专利权。",
"Permissions of this strongest copyleft license are conditioned on making available complete source code of licensed works and modifications, which include larger works using a licensed work, under the same license. Copyright and license notices must be preserved. Contributors provide an express grant of patent rights. When a modified version is used to provide a service over a network, the complete source code of the modified version must be made available.":"这种最强 Copyleft 许可证的授权条件是以相同许可证公开被许可作品和修改版本的完整源码，修改版本包括使用被许可作品的更大作品。必须保留版权和许可证声明。贡献者明确授予专利权。通过网络使用修改版本提供服务时，必须公开修改版本的完整源码。",
"The GNU GPL is the most widely used free software license and has a strong copyleft requirement. When distributing derived works, the source code of the work must be made available under the same license. There are multiple variants of the GNU GPL, each with different requirements.":"GNU GPL 是使用最广泛且具有强 Copyleft 要求的自由软件许可证。分发衍生作品时，必须以相同许可证公开作品源码。GNU GPL 有多个变体，各自要求不同。",
"Permissions of this copyleft license are conditioned on making available complete source code of licensed works and modifications under the same license or the GNU GPLv3. Copyright and license notices must be preserved. Contributors provide an express grant of patent rights. However, a larger work using the licensed work through interfaces provided by the licensed work may be distributed under different terms and without source code for the larger work.":"这种 Copyleft 许可证的授权条件是以相同许可证或 GNU GPLv3 公开被许可作品及其修改版本的完整源码。必须保留版权和许可证声明。贡献者明确授予专利权。但通过被许可作品提供的接口使用它的更大作品可以按不同条款分发且无需提供该更大作品的源码。",
"Primarily used for software libraries, the GNU LGPL requires that derived works be licensed under the same license, but works that only link to it do not fall under this restriction. There are two commonly used versions of the GNU LGPL.":"GNU LGPL 主要用于软件库，要求衍生作品使用相同许可证，但仅链接到它的作品不受此限制。GNU LGPL 有两个常用版本。",
"Permissions of this weak copyleft license are conditioned on making available source code of licensed files and modifications of those files under the same license (or in certain cases, one of the GNU licenses). Copyright and license notices must be preserved. Contributors provide an express grant of patent rights. However, a larger work using the licensed work may be distributed under different terms and without source code for files added in the larger work.":"这种弱 Copyleft 许可证的授权条件是以相同许可证（某些情况下可为 GNU 许可证之一）公开被许可文件及其修改的源码。必须保留版权和许可证声明。贡献者明确授予专利权。但使用被许可作品的更大作品可以按不同条款分发且无需提供其中新增文件的源码。",
"A simple permissive license only requiring preservation of copyright and license notices for source (and not binary) distribution. Licensed works, modifications, and larger works may be distributed under different terms and without source code.":"一种仅要求分发源码（而非二进制文件）时保留版权和许可证声明的简单宽松许可证。被许可作品、修改版本和更大的作品可以按不同条款分发且无需提供源码。",
"A license with no conditions whatsoever which dedicates works to the public domain. Unlicensed works, modifications, and larger works may be distributed under different terms and without source code.":"一种没有任何条件并将作品贡献到公有领域的许可证。采用此许可证的作品、修改版本和更大的作品可以按不同条款分发且无需提供源码。",
"A short and simple permissive license with no conditions, not even requiring preservation of copyright and license notices. Licensed works, modifications, and larger works may be distributed under different terms and without source code.":"一种没有任何条件的简短宽松许可证，甚至不要求保留版权和许可证声明。被许可作品、修改版本和更大的作品可以按不同条款分发且无需提供源码。",
"The BSD Zero Clause license goes further than the BSD 2-Clause license to allow you unlimited freedom with the software without requirements to include the copyright notice, license text, or disclaimer in either source or binary forms.":"BSD 零条款许可证比 BSD 2-Clause 许可证更进一步，允许你不受限制地使用软件且源码和二进制形式都无需附带版权声明、许可证文本或免责声明。",
"Heavily favored by the Perl community, the Artistic license requires that modified versions of the software do not prevent users from running the standard version.":"Artistic 许可证深受 Perl 社区青睐，要求软件的修改版本不得妨碍用户运行标准版本。",
"This commercially-friendly copyleft license provides the ability to commercially license binaries; a modern royalty-free patent license grant; and the ability for linked works to use other licenses, including commercial ones.":"这种对商业友好的 Copyleft 许可证允许对二进制文件进行商业授权；提供现代的免版税专利许可；并允许链接作品使用其他许可证，包括商业许可证。",
"Permits almost any use subject to providing credit and license notice. Frequently used for media assets and educational materials. The most common license for Open Access scientific publications. Not recommended for software.":"只要注明出处并附上许可证声明即允许几乎任何用途。常用于媒体资源和教育材料。开放获取科学出版物最常用的许可证。不建议用于软件。",
