"The easiest license out there. It gives the user permissions to do whatever they want with your code.":"最简单的许可证。它允许用户对你的代码做任何事。",
"A short permissive license, compatible with GPL. Requires altered source versions to be documented as such.":"一种简短的宽松许可证，与 GPL 兼容。要求注明源码的修改版本。",
