"The Academic Free License is a variant of the Open Software License that does not require that the source code of derivative works be disclosed. It contains explicit copyright and patent grants and reserves trademark rights in the author.":"学术自由许可证是不要求公开衍生作品源码的开放软件许可证变体。它明确授予版权和专利权并为作者保留商标权。",
"A permissive license whose main conditions require providing notice of the license. Contributors provide an express grant of patent rights. Licensed works, modifications, and larger works may be distributed under different terms and without source code.":"一种主要以提供许可证声明为条件的宽松许可证。贡献者明确授予专利权。被许可作品、修改版本和更大的作品可以按不同条款分发且无需提供源码。",
"This license is designed to provide: a) a simple permissive license; b) that is compatible with the GNU GPL-2.0; and c) which also has an express patent grant included.":"此许可证旨在提供：a) 一种简单的宽松许可证；b) 与 GNU GPL-2.0 兼容；c) 同时明确包含专利授权。",
"Strong copyleft license made by three French public research organisations, CEA, CNRS, and Inria, compatible with AGPL-3.0, EUPL-1.1, and GPL-2.0, or later versions of those licenses.":"由法国三家公共研究机构 CEA、CNRS 和 Inria 制定的强 Copyleft 许可证，与 AGPL-3.0、EUPL-1.1 和 GPL-2.0 或这些许可证的更高版本兼容。",
"A permissive license for hardware designs, with conditions only requiring preservation of notices. Contributors provide an express grant of patent rights. Licensed works, modifications, and larger works may be distributed under different terms and without sources.":"一种用于硬件设计的宽松许可证，仅以保留声明为条件。贡献者明确授予专利权。被许可作品、修改版本和更大的作品可以按不同条款分发且无需提供源文件。",
"Permissions of this strongly reciprocal license for hardware designs are conditioned on making available complete sources of licensed works and modifications, which include larger works using a licensed work, under the same license. Notices must be preserved. Contributors provide an express grant of patent rights.":"这种用于硬件设计的强互惠许可证的授权条件是以相同许可证公开被许可作品和修改版本的完整源文件，修改版本包括使用被许可作品的更大作品。必须保留声明。贡献者明确授予专利权。",
"Permissions of this weakly-reciprocal license are conditioned on making available complete sources of licensed works and modifications under the same license. Notices must be preserved. Contributors provide an express grant of patent rights. However, a larger work using the licensed work through interfaces provided by the licensed work may be distributed under different terms and without sources for the larger work.":"这种弱互惠许可证的授权条件是以相同许可证公开被许可作品和修改版本的完整源文件。必须保留声明。贡献者明确授予专利权。但通过被许可作品提供的接口使用它的更大作品可以按不同条款分发且无需提供该更大作品的源文件。",
"The Educational Community License version 2.0 (\"ECL\") consists of the Apache 2.0 license, modified to change the scope of the patent grant in section 3 to be specific to the needs of the education communities using this license.":"教育社区许可证 2.0 版 (ECL) 由 Apache 2.0 许可证修改而来，将第 3 节中专利授权的范围改为专门针对使用此许可证的教育社区的需要。",
"The “European Union Public Licence” (EUPL) is a copyleft free/open source software license created on the initiative of and approved by the European Commission in 22 official languages of the European Union.":"“欧盟公共许可证” (EUPL) 是由欧盟委员会发起并以欧盟 22 种官方语言版本批准的 Copyleft 自由/开源软件许可证。",
"A copyleft license for software documentation.":"一种用于软件文档的 Copyleft 许可证。",
"The LaTeX Project Public License (LPPL) is the primary license under which the LaTeX kernel and the base LaTeX packages are distributed.":"LaTeX 项目公共许可证 (LPPL) 是 LaTeX 内核和 LaTeX 基础宏包分发时采用的主要许可证。",
"An open source license with a patent grant.":"一种附带专利授权的开源许可证。",
"The Open Database License (ODbL) is a license agreement intended to allow users to freely share, modify, and use a database while maintaining this same freedom for others.":"开放数据库许可证 (ODbL) 是一种许可协议，旨在允许用户自由共享、修改和使用数据库，同时为他人保留同样的自由。",
"Permissions of this copyleft license are conditioned on distributing source code of licensed works and modifications under the same license. Copyright and license notices must be preserved. Contributors provide an express grant of patent rights. Using the work or modifications to provide services to external users is treated as distribution and also requires making source code available. Works that merely link to a licensed work are considered collective works and are not subject to the license's reciprocity requirements.":"这种 Copyleft 许可证的授权条件是以相同许可证分发被许可作品和修改版本的源码。必须保留版权和许可证声明。贡献者明确授予专利权。使用作品或修改版本向外部用户提供服务视为分发并同样需要公开源码。仅链接到被许可作品的作品视为集合作品且不受此许可证互惠要求的约束。",
"A very short, BSD-style license, used specifically for PostgreSQL.":"一种非常简短的 BSD 风格许可证，专用于 PostgreSQL。",
"A permissive, OSI- and FSF-approved, GPL-compatible license, expressly allowing attribution with just a copyright notice and a short form link rather than the full text of the license. Includes an express grant of patent rights. Licensed works and modifications may be distributed under different terms and without source code, and the patent grant may also optionally be expanded to larger works to permit use as a contributor license agreement.":"一种获 OSI 和 FSF 批准、与 GPL 兼容的宽松许可证，明确允许仅以版权声明和简短链接而非许可证全文的形式署名。包含明确的专利授权。被许可作品和修改版本可以按不同条款分发且无需提供源码，专利授权还可选择扩展到更大的作品，以便用作贡献者许可协议。",
"There are no restrictions on using or distributing an unmodified copy of the software. Parts of the software may also be distributed, but the license text must always be included. For modified versions a few restrictions apply. The license is GPL compatible, you may compile the software with GPL libraries and distribute it.":"使用或分发软件的未修改副本不受任何限制。也可以分发软件的部分内容，但必须始终附带许可证文本。修改版本有少量限制。此许可证与 GPL 兼容，你可以将软件与 GPL 库一起编译并分发。",
