"Sometimes, a company has to leave the Student Developer Pack and no longer offers their resources to students through our system. In some cases, it’s because the company has decided to offer their own student benefit directly. In other cases, it’s because offering a free benefit isn’t aligned with their business goals. For the most up to date list of Pack partners, visit our Student Developer Pack public repository, which is updated regularly.":"有时，某家公司不得不退出学生开发人员包，不再通过我们的系统向学生提供资源。有些情况是因为该公司决定直接提供自己的学生福利，另一些情况则是因为提供免费福利与其业务目标不符。要获取最新的开发人员包合作伙伴列表，请访问我们的学生开发人员包公共存储库，该存储库定期更新。",
"Sometimes, a company has to leave the Student Developer Pack and no longer offers their resources to students through our system. In some cases, it’s because the company has decided to offer their own student benefit directly. In other cases, it’s because offering a free benefit isn’t aligned with their business goals. For the most up to date list of Pack partners, visit our":"有时，某家公司不得不退出学生开发人员包，不再通过我们的系统向学生提供资源。有些情况是因为该公司决定直接提供自己的学生福利，另一些情况则是因为提供免费福利与其业务目标不符。要获取最新的开发人员包合作伙伴列表，请访问我们的",
