"Give your students a head start with GitHub Teams for education—offered at no cost. They’ll collaborate on projects in private repositories, handle access with advanced tools, and master industry-standard workflows. This mirrors the professional development environment, nurturing essential skills for their future tech careers.":"让你的学生用面向教育的 GitHub 团队版赢在起跑线——免费提供。他们将在专用存储库中协作完成项目，使用高级工具管理访问权限，并掌握行业标准工作流。这与专业开发环境如出一辙，培养他们未来技术职业所需的关键技能。",
"Learn more about GitHub Team":"了解 GitHub 团队版",
"Harness the AI power of GitHub Copilot Pro":"发挥 GitHub Copilot 专业版的 AI 力量",
"Enhance your curriculum with AI-powered code suggestions and assignment generation, simplifying lesson planning and encouraging student engagement. It’s free for verified educators.":"用 AI 驱动的代码建议和作业生成增强你的课程，简化教案规划并提高学生参与度。已验证的教育工作者可免费使用。",
"Learn more about GitHub Copilot":"了解 GitHub Copilot",
"Grow your network with Teacher Discussions":"通过教师讨论拓展你的人脉",
"Join our invitation-only Teacher Discussions to connect with a global network of educators where you can share innovative teaching strategies and explore new ideas.":"加入我们仅限邀请的教师讨论，与全球教育工作者网络建立联系，分享创新教学策略并探索新想法。",
"Join us today and take the first step toward transforming the way you teach.":"立即加入我们，迈出改变你教学方式的第一步。",
"Read GitHub Education blog posts":"阅读 GitHub 教育博客文章",
"Codio is a hands-on learning platform that combines interactive courseware, browser-based coding environments, and auto grading in one place. Instructors get free access — no cost to create curriculum, use the migration tool, or explore the full platform.":"Codio 是一个动手学习平台，将交互式课件、基于浏览器的编码环境和自动评分集于一处。讲师可免费使用——创建课程、使用迁移工具或探索完整平台均不收费。",
"Explore codio":"探索 codio",
"Classroom 50 is a free, open-source alternative to GitHub Classroom from the Fifty Foundation. It helps teachers distribute assignments, configure auto-grading with GitHub Actions, and review student submissions through both web and command-line interfaces.":"Classroom 50 是 Fifty Foundation 推出的 GitHub 课堂免费开源替代方案。它帮助教师分发作业、使用 GitHub 操作配置自动评分，并通过网页和命令行界面审查学生提交的内容。",
"Explore Classroom 50":"探索 Classroom 50",
"The Teacher Toolbox is your central go-to resource for all things GitHub. It includes helpful links, guides, learning modules, sample curriculum, use cases, videos, and articles to help teachers use GitHub in the classroom.":"教师工具箱是你了解 GitHub 一切内容的核心资源。它包含实用链接、指南、学习模块、示例课程、使用场景、视频和文章，帮助教师在课堂中使用 GitHub。",
