": Jump-start your development journey with the GitHub Student Developer Pack, offering dozens of premium tools and services at no cost. From AI-powered coding assistance with free access to Copilot, to GitHub Codespaces which provide a fully configured cloud development environment, these tools are used daily by professional developers globally. They’d normally cost a fortune, but are available for free to verified students.":"：通过 GitHub 学生开发人员包快速开启你的开发之旅，免费获得数十款高级工具和服务。从可免费使用 Copilot 的 AI 驱动编码辅助，到提供完整配置云端开发环境的 GitHub 代码空间，这些工具是全球专业开发人员每天都在使用的。它们通常价格不菲，但已验证的学生可免费使用。",
"How can I qualify for GitHub Education benefits as a teacher?":"作为教师，我如何获得 GitHub 教育福利的资格？",
"To access GitHub Education benefits, you need to be a currently employed educator at an accredited educational institution. Please apply by submitting proof of academic employment, such as a faculty ID or employment verification letter, using your institutional email address through our":"要获得 GitHub 教育福利，你需要是经认证教育机构的在职教育工作者。请提交学术任职证明（如教职工 ID 或在职证明信），使用你的机构电子邮件地址，通过我们的",
"GitHub Education for Teachers":"面向教师的 GitHub 教育",
"How do I access free GitHub Copilot Pro?":"如何免费使用 GitHub Copilot 专业版？",
"This free benefit is available to teachers who qualify for GitHub Education. To apply, please provide proof of your current academic position using your official academic email address along with supplementary documents, such as a faculty ID or an employment verification letter, via our Teacher Application. You can find more information in our":"此免费福利面向符合 GitHub 教育资格的教师。要申请，请通过我们的教师申请，使用你的官方学术电子邮件地址提供当前学术职位证明，并附上补充文件（如教职工 ID 或在职证明信）。更多信息请参阅我们的",
"GitHub Education for educators":"面向教育工作者的 GitHub 教育",
"documentation page.":"文档页面。",
"What should I do if my application for GitHub Education benefits was not approved?":"如果我的 GitHub 教育福利申请未获批准，该怎么办？",
"If your application was not approved, it may be due to insufficient proof of current academic employment or affiliation with a non-degree granting institution. Ensure your application includes a clear academic email address and proper employment documentation. You may update your information and reapply as needed.":"如果你的申请未获批准，可能是因为当前学术任职证明不足，或所属机构不授予学位。请确保你的申请包含清晰的学术电子邮件地址和适当的任职文件。你可以根据需要更新信息并重新申请。",
