"Build your skills and launch your future with GitHub":"用 GitHub 提升技能并开启你的未来",
"Code in the cloud with GitHub Codespaces":"使用 GitHub 代码空间在云端编码",
"GitHub Codespaces provides a powerful, cloud-based development environment accessible from any device with internet access. Codespaces offers a consistent, customizable platform that scales with your development needs, supporting your journey from beginner to advanced projects, wherever you are.":"GitHub 代码空间提供强大的云端开发环境，任何联网设备都能访问。代码空间提供一致、可自定义的平台，随你的开发需求扩展，无论身在何处，都支持你从入门到高级项目的进阶之旅。",
"Learn faster and code better with GitHub Copilot Student":"借助 GitHub Copilot 学生版更快学习并写出更好的代码",
"GitHub Copilot Student is your AI-powered coding companion. Available for free to verified students, teachers, and open-source maintainers, Copilot offers real-time, context-aware code suggestions right in your editor—whether you're learning the ropes or an experienced developer.":"GitHub Copilot 学生版是你的 AI 驱动编码伙伴。已验证的学生、教师和开源维护者可免费使用，Copilot 直接在你的编辑器中提供实时、感知上下文的代码建议——无论你是初学者还是经验丰富的开发人员。",
"is your AI-powered coding companion. Available for free to verified students, teachers, and open-source maintainers, Copilot offers real-time, context-aware code suggestions right in your editor—whether you're learning the ropes or an experienced developer.":"是你的 AI 驱动编码伙伴。已验证的学生、教师和开源维护者可免费使用，Copilot 直接在你的编辑器中提供实时、感知上下文的代码建议——无论你是初学者还是经验丰富的开发人员。",
"Become a leader in tech with GitHub Campus Experts":"通过 GitHub 校园专家成为技术领袖",
"As a GitHub Campus Expert, you’ll receive training and support to enhance your skills in public speaking, technical writing, community management, and more. Start making a significant impact at your campus and build your future in technology today.":"作为 GitHub 校园专家，你将获得培训和支持，提升公开演讲、技术写作、社区管理等技能。立即开始在你的校园产生重大影响，构建你的技术未来。",
"Learn more about Campus Experts":"了解校园专家",
"Work on real-world projects with Community Exchange":"通过社区交流参与真实项目",
"Find and collaborate on projects that take your skills further. Community Exchange brings together students and educators to share valuable learning resources, from code samples and tutorials to full projects. Whether you're contributing your own work or helping others, this is where you expand your knowledge through practical experience.":"寻找并协作参与能进一步提升你技能的项目。社区交流汇聚学生和教育工作者，共享宝贵的学习资源，从代码示例、教程到完整项目。无论是贡献自己的作品还是帮助他人，这里都是你通过实践拓展知识的地方。",
"The Student Developer Pack":"学生开发人员包",
"Discover the Student Developer Pack":"探索学生开发人员包",
"Access professional developer tools and partner offers at no cost.":"免费使用专业开发人员工具和合作伙伴优惠。",
"Build skills with step-by-step Learning Paths for every experience level.":"通过面向各经验水平的分步学习路径提升技能。",
"Explore curated Experiences in Web Development, Data Science & Machine Learning, and more.":"探索 Web 开发、数据科学与机器学习等领域的精选体验。",
"Subscribe to our newsletter":"订阅我们的通讯",
"Am I eligible to get the Student Developer Pack?":"我是否有资格获得学生开发人员包？",
"If you’re a student aged 13+ and enrolled in a degree or diploma-granting course of study, the GitHub Student Developer Pack is for you. All you need is a school-issued email address and/or official, dated proof of enrollment. For more information about the application process and what documents we accept, please read our docs on applying.":"如果你是 13 岁及以上、就读于授予学位或文凭课程的学生，GitHub 学生开发人员包就是为你准备的。你只需要一个学校电子邮件地址和/或带日期的官方在读证明。有关申请流程和我们接受的文件的更多信息，请阅读我们的申请文档。",
"If you’re a student aged 13+ and enrolled in a degree or diploma-granting course of study, the GitHub Student Developer Pack is for you. All you need is a school-issued email address and/or official, dated proof of enrollment. For more information about the application process and what documents we accept, please":"如果你是 13 岁及以上、就读于授予学位或文凭课程的学生，GitHub 学生开发人员包就是为你准备的。你只需要一个学校电子邮件地址和/或带日期的官方在读证明。有关申请流程和我们接受的文件的更多信息，请",
"read our docs on applying":"阅读我们的申请文档",
"Empowering the next generation of developers":"赋能下一代开发人员",
"GitHub Education bridges the gap between coding education and a tech career, and is accessible to everyone globally at no cost.":"GitHub 教育弥合编程教育与技术职业之间的鸿沟，面向全球所有人免费开放。",
"Connect with millions of peers who've expanded their skills through GitHub Education.":"与数百万通过 GitHub 教育提升技能的同伴建立联系。",
"Collaborate with educators around the world who enhance their lesson plans and workstreams with GitHub tools.":"与世界各地使用 GitHub 工具改进教案和工作流的教育工作者协作。",
"Join thousands of schools globally that incorporate GitHub into their tech curriculum.":"加入全球数千所将 GitHub 纳入技术课程的学校。",
"More than a platform.":"不止是一个平台。",
"GitHub Education is a commitment to bringing tech and open source collaboration to students and educators across the globe.":"GitHub 教育致力于将技术和开源协作带给全球的学生和教育工作者。",
"Join us today":"立即加入我们",
"and take the first step towards transforming your tech education experience.":"，迈出改变你的技术教育体验的第一步。",
"Enable GitHub Education":"启用 GitHub 教育",
"Join a community where learning meets doing, with free access to the same tools professional developers use, including GitHub Copilot Student and Codespaces.":"加入一个学以致用的社区，免费使用专业开发人员使用的同款工具，包括 GitHub Copilot 学生版和代码空间。",
"Learn more about students":"了解学生相关信息",
"Connect with a community of peers, expand your teaching methods, and empower students to dream big.":"与同行社区建立联系，拓展教学方法，赋能学生勇敢追梦。",
"Learn more about teachers":"了解教师相关信息",
"Enhance your technical and academic departments with real-world software solutions, thanks to free access to GitHub Enterprise.":"免费使用 GitHub 企业版，用真实的软件解决方案提升你的技术和学术部门。",
"Learn more about schools":"了解学校相关信息",
"Expand your brand's footprint in the tech landscape and ensure the tech leaders of tomorrow know your tools by name by partnering with GitHub Education.":"与 GitHub 教育合作，扩大你的品牌在技术领域的影响力，让未来的技术领袖熟知你的工具。",
"Learn more about partners":"了解合作伙伴相关信息",
"Go further":"更进一步",
"Begin your GitHub Education journey":"开启你的 GitHub 教育之旅",
"Join us today and take the first step towards transforming your tech education experience.":"立即加入我们，迈出改变你的技术教育体验的第一步。",
