"Go further with these":"借助以下内容更进一步",
"From cloud hosting to development platforms and premium educational content, the Student Developer Pack includes dozens of partner offers and resources that will allow students to use professional tools at no cost.":"从云托管、开发平台到高级教育内容，学生开发人员包包含数十项合作伙伴优惠和资源，让学生免费使用专业工具。",
"See the pack":"查看开发人员包",
"Have questions or need help? Join in on the conversation and meet fellow students and teachers all learning together with GitHub.":"有疑问或需要帮助？加入讨论，结识同样在使用 GitHub 学习的学生和教师。",
"Learn how to use GitHub with interactive courses designed for beginners and experts.":"通过为初学者和专家设计的交互式课程学习如何使用 GitHub。",
"What is GitHub Education?":"GitHub 教育是什么？",
"GitHub Education is a community dedicated to empowering the next generation of developers through the power of open-source education. Whether you're a student eager to make your mark, an educator aiming to inspire, or an early career developer looking to sharpen your skills, GitHub Education is here to help you succeed.":"GitHub 教育是一个致力于通过开源教育的力量赋能下一代开发人员的社区。无论你是渴望崭露头角的学生、希望启发他人的教育工作者，还是想要磨炼技能的职业生涯早期开发人员，GitHub 教育都会助你成功。",
"Why Join GitHub Education?":"为什么加入 GitHub 教育？",
"Free access to tools":"免费使用工具",
"Real-world experience":"实践经验",
": Engage in open source projects and collaborative development to gain practical experience and build a portfolio of contributions. This hands-on approach prepares you for a successful career in tech, offering real-world application and visibility.":"：参与开源项目和协作开发，积累实践经验并建立贡献作品集。这种动手实践的方式为你在技术领域的成功职业生涯做好准备，带来真实的应用场景和曝光度。",
"Exclusive learning content":"独家学习内容",
": Explore our Learning Paths to find structured educational content designed to guide your learning. These paths provide a clear progression through different tech topics, helping you enhance your knowledge and skills at your own pace.":"：探索我们的学习路径，找到旨在引导你学习的结构化教育内容。这些路径提供贯穿不同技术主题的清晰进阶，帮助你按自己的节奏提升知识和技能。",
"Global network":"全球网络",
