"Security and compliance information saved":"安全与合规信息已保存",
"Provide available details about your extension's safety and security measures. Include any applicable information about: - Security Measures: authentication methods, access controls, incident response plans - Data Handling: data encryption, data collection and usage, privacy protections, data retention policies, cross-border transfers (if applicable) - Compliance: list any compliance certifications, links to reports, and expiration dates (e.g. SOC II/III, ISO 27001, HIPAA, GDPR, FedRAMP) - High-Risk Systems: If you declared your extension as high-risk under EU AI Act, also include system accuracy metrics, human oversight procedures, risk monitoring methods and known limitations Please link to supporting documentation where available and use H2 headers (##) for better readability.":"提供扩展的安全保障措施的现有详细信息。请包括以下适用信息：\n\n- 安全措施：身份验证方法、访问控制、事件响应计划\n- 数据处理：数据加密、数据收集和使用、隐私保护、数据保留策略、跨境传输（如适用）\n- 合规：列出合规认证、报告链接和到期日期（例如 SOC II/III、ISO 27001、HIPAA、GDPR、FedRAMP）\n- 高风险系统：如果已根据欧盟《人工智能法》将扩展声明为高风险，还需包括系统准确性指标、人工监督程序、风险监控方法和已知限制\n\n请尽可能链接到支持文档并使用 H2 标题 (##) 以提高可读性。",
