"Edit runner type for Copilot cloud agent":"编辑 Copilot 云端智能体的运行器类型",
"Copilot cloud agent will use standard GitHub runners.":"Copilot 云端智能体将使用标准 GitHub 运行器。",
"Copilot cloud agent will use labeled GitHub or self-hosted runners that you may define.":"Copilot 云端智能体将使用你定义的带标签的 GitHub 运行器或自托管运行器。",
"AI coding agent for tasks, projects, and automated work. Once you complete onboarding, you’ll have the ability to manage policies and control which users or teams will have access to":"用于任务、项目和自动化工作的 AI 编码智能体。完成入门设置后，你可以管理策略，并控制组织内哪些用户或团队可以使用",
"AI coding agent for tasks, projects, and automated work. Once you complete onboarding, you'll have the ability to manage policies and control which users or teams will have access to":"用于任务、项目和自动化工作的 AI 编码智能体。完成入门设置后，你可以管理策略，并控制组织内哪些用户或团队可以使用",
"You can enable Copilot in the cloud for other users, but you won't be able to assign tasks to Copilot because you don't have a Copilot Pro, Copilot Pro+, Copilot Business or Copilot Enterprise license.":"你可以为其他用户启用云端 Copilot，但因没有 Copilot 专业版、Copilot 专业增强版、Copilot 商业版或 Copilot 企业版许可证而无法向 Copilot 分配任务。",
"Buy or request a seat":"购买或申请席位",
"With Copilot in the cloud, developers can delegate tasks to Copilot, freeing them to focus on the creative, complex, and high-impact work that matters most. Simply assign a task to Copilot, wait for the agent to request review, then leave feedback on the pull request to iterate.":"借助云端 Copilot，开发人员可以把任务委派给 Copilot，从而专注于最重要的创造性、复杂和高影响力的工作。只需向 Copilot 分配任务，等待智能体请求审查，然后在拉取请求上留下反馈进行迭代。",
"Choose which repositories Copilot in the cloud should be enabled in. You can select up to 500 repositories or enable all repositories. To be able to assign an issue to Copilot, the user must have access to Copilot in the cloud and it must be enabled for the repository.":"选择要在哪些存储库中启用云端 Copilot。最多可选择 500 个存储库，也可以为所有存储库启用。要将议题分配给 Copilot，用户必须有权使用云端 Copilot，且存储库已启用该功能。",
"Let users with write access create automations that run on a schedule or in response to events.":"允许具有写入权限的用户创建按计划或响应事件运行的自动化。",
"Allow shared automations":"允许共享自动化",
"Shared automations belong to the repository and run as the organization, so their usage is billed to the organization. When disabled, shared automations are hidden and the organization isn't billed for them.":"共享自动化属于存储库并以组织身份运行，因此用量向组织计费。禁用后，共享自动化将隐藏，组织也不会为其付费。",
"Require write access to trigger automations":"需要写入权限才能触发自动化",
"Automations only run for events from users with write access.":"自动化仅针对具有写入权限的用户触发的事件运行。",
"Only allow automations to update the resource that triggered them":"仅允许自动化更新触发它的资源",
"Runs can only change the issue, pull request, or discussion that triggered them, and anything the run created. Doesn't apply to scheduled runs, security alert runs, or runs started by another automation.":"运行只能更改触发它的议题、拉取请求或讨论，以及该运行创建的内容。不适用于计划运行、安全警报运行或由其他自动化启动的运行。",
"Require approval for workflows on automation pull requests":"自动化拉取请求上的工作流需要批准",
"Workflows on automation pull requests wait for approval, even in repositories that let workflows run on Copilot's changes without approval.":"自动化拉取请求上的工作流会等待批准，即使存储库允许工作流在 Copilot 的更改上无需批准即可运行。",
"Some settings have moved":"部分设置已移动",
"Enabling an agent allows it to be mentioned in issues and pull requests, and assigned to issues and open pull requests. Agents can only be triggered by organization members and repository collaborators, and can only be used in this organization's repositories where the cloud agent feature is enabled.":"启用智能体后，可以在议题和拉取请求中提及它，并将其分配给议题和打开的拉取请求。智能体只能由组织成员和存储库协作者触发，且只能在此组织已启用云端智能体功能的存储库中使用。",
"Select the default runner type for Copilot cloud agent sessions.":"选择 Copilot 云端智能体会话的默认运行器类型。",
"Select the runner type for Copilot cloud agent sessions.":"选择 Copilot 云端智能体会话的运行器类型。",
