"Select the runner type for Copilot code review sessions.":"选择 Copilot 代码审查会话的运行器类型。",
"Repositories in this organization will use the selected runner type unless overridden at the repository level.":"除非在存储库级别覆盖，否则此组织中的存储库将使用所选运行器类型。",
"When enabled, repositories can specify their own runner via their copilot-setup-steps.yml file.":"启用后，存储库可以通过各自的 copilot-setup-steps.yml 文件指定运行器。",
"When enabled, repositories can specify their own runner via their copilot-code-review.yml file.":"启用后，存储库可以通过各自的 copilot-code-review.yml 文件指定运行器。",
