"With Copilot cloud agent, developers can delegate tasks to Copilot, freeing them to focus on the creative, complex, and high-impact work that matters most. Assign a task to Copilot, wait for the agent to request review, then leave feedback on the pull request to iterate.":"借助 Copilot 云端智能体，开发人员可以把任务委派给 Copilot，从而专注于最重要的创造性、复杂和高影响力的工作。向 Copilot 分配任务，等待智能体请求审查，然后在拉取请求上留下反馈进行迭代。",
", developers can delegate tasks to Copilot, freeing them to focus on the creative, complex, and high-impact work that matters most. Assign a task to Copilot, wait for the agent to request review, then leave feedback on the pull request to iterate.":"，开发人员可以把任务委派给 Copilot，从而专注于最重要的创造性、复杂和高影响力的工作。向 Copilot 分配任务，等待智能体请求审查，然后在拉取请求上留下反馈进行迭代。",
"With Copilot coding agent, developers can delegate tasks to Copilot, freeing them to focus on the creative, complex, and high-impact work that matters most. Simply assign an issue to Copilot, wait for the agent to request review, then leave feedback on the pull request to iterate. To learn more, see the":"借助 Copilot 编码智能体，开发人员可以把任务委派给 Copilot，从而专注于最重要的创造性、复杂和高影响力的工作。只需将议题分配给 Copilot，等待智能体请求审查，然后在拉取请求上留下反馈进行迭代。详情请参阅",
"With Copilot coding agent, developers can delegate tasks to Copilot, freeing them to focus on the creative, complex, and high-impact work that matters most. Assign an issue to Copilot, wait for the agent to request review, then leave feedback on the pull request to iterate.":"借助 Copilot 编码智能体，开发人员可以把任务委派给 Copilot，从而专注于最重要的创造性、复杂和高影响力的工作。将议题分配给 Copilot，等待智能体请求审查，然后在拉取请求上留下反馈进行迭代。",
"Learn more about Copilot coding agent":"了解 Copilot 编码智能体",
"Learn more about Copilot in the cloud":"了解云端 Copilot",
"No Copilot in the cloud access":"无云端 Copilot 访问权限",
"Require approval for workflow runs":"工作流运行需要批准",
"When Copilot pushes changes, require approval from a maintainer with write access before Actions workflows are run. When this policy is disabled, Actions workflows run automatically when Copilot pushes, except when the push comes from an automation that requires approval.":"Copilot 推送更改后，须由拥有写入访问权限的维护者批准，GitHub 操作工作流才会运行。禁用此策略后，Copilot 推送时 GitHub 操作工作流会自动运行，除非推送来自需要批准的自动化。",
"When Copilot pushes changes, require approval from a maintainer with write access before Actions workflows are run.":"Copilot 推送更改后，须由拥有写入访问权限的维护者批准，GitHub 操作工作流才会运行。",
"Allowing GitHub Actions workflows to run without approval may allow unreviewed code written by Copilot to gain write access to your repository or access your GitHub Actions secrets.":"允许 GitHub 操作工作流未经批准运行，可能让 Copilot 编写的未审查代码获得存储库写入访问权限或访问 GitHub 操作机密。",
"Configure which tools Copilot cloud agent uses to validate its work and iterate before requesting human review.":"配置 Copilot 云端智能体在请求人工审查前用于验证工作并迭代的工具。",
"Configure which tools Copilot in the cloud uses to validate its work and iterate before requesting human review.":"配置云端 Copilot 在请求人工审查前用于验证工作并迭代的工具。",
"Actions workflows wait for approval from someone with write access before they run on Copilot's changes.":"GitHub 操作工作流在 Copilot 的更改上运行前，须等待拥有写入访问权限的人员批准。",
"Actions workflows wait for approval from someone with write access before they run on Copilot’s changes.":"GitHub 操作工作流在 Copilot 的更改上运行前，须等待拥有写入访问权限的人员批准。",
"Sandbox resources":"沙盒资源",
"Choose the compute size for new cloud agent sandboxes. Existing sandboxes keep their current size. For tasks using multiple repositories, the largest repository setting is used.":"为新的云端智能体沙盒选择计算规格。现有沙盒保持当前规格。对于使用多个存储库的任务，采用其中最大的存储库设置。",
"Sandbox size":"沙盒规格",
