"Save sandbox size":"保存沙盒规格",
"When enabled, users with write access can create automations that automatically run agents on a schedule or in response to events like new issues or updated pull requests.":"启用后，拥有写入访问权限的用户可以创建自动化，按计划或在出现新议题、拉取请求更新等事件时自动运行智能体。",
"Only allow automations to be triggered by users with write access":"仅允许拥有写入访问权限的用户触发自动化",
"When enabled, automations will only run if the user triggering the event has write access to the repository. When disabled, users can create automations that listen for events triggered by users without write access.":"启用后，只有触发事件的用户拥有存储库写入访问权限时，自动化才会运行。禁用后，用户可以创建监听无写入访问权限用户所触发事件的自动化。",
"Allowing automations to be triggered by users without write access to the repository increases risk of prompt injection attacks, where an untrusted user can cause an agent to take actions in the repository using the agent's permissions.":"允许无存储库写入访问权限的用户触发自动化会增加提示注入攻击的风险，不受信任的用户可能利用智能体的权限让其在存储库中执行操作。",
"Allowing automations to be triggered by users without write access to the repository increases risk of prompt injection attacks, where an untrusted user can cause an agent to take actions in the repository using the agent’s permissions.":"允许无存储库写入访问权限的用户触发自动化会增加提示注入攻击的风险，不受信任的用户可能利用智能体的权限让其在存储库中执行操作。",
"Limit automation writes to the triggering resource":"将自动化的写入限制在触发资源内",
"When enabled, automation runs can only change the issue, pull request, or discussion that triggered them, and anything they create. This does not apply to scheduled runs, security alert runs, or runs started by another automation.":"启用后，自动化运行只能更改触发它的议题、拉取请求或讨论，以及它自己创建的内容。此限制不适用于计划运行、安全警报运行或由其他自动化启动的运行。",
"Shared automations belong to the repository and run as its owner, so their usage is billed to the owner. When disabled, shared automations are hidden and the owner isn't billed for them.":"共享自动化归属于存储库并以其所有者身份运行，因此使用量计费给所有者。禁用后，共享自动化将被隐藏，所有者也不会为其付费。",
"Shared automations belong to the repository and run as its owner, so their usage is billed to the owner. When disabled, shared automations are hidden and the owner isn’t billed for them.":"共享自动化归属于存储库并以其所有者身份运行，因此使用量计费给所有者。禁用后，共享自动化将被隐藏，所有者也不会为其付费。",
