"Host your own software packages or use them as dependencies in other projects. Both private and public hosting available. Packages are free for public repositories.":"托管你自己的软件包或在其他项目中将其用作依赖项。支持专用和公共托管。公共存储库免费使用软件包。",
"Review new code, see visual code changes, and confidently merge code changes with automated status checks.":"审查新代码、查看可视化的代码更改，并借助自动状态检查放心合并代码更改。",
"Allow contributors to easily notify you of changes they've pushed to a repository – with access limited to the contributors you specify. Easily merge changes you accept.":"让贡献者轻松通知你他们推送到存储库的更改，访问权限仅限于你指定的贡献者。轻松合并你接受的更改。",
"Allow contributors to easily notify you of changes they’ve pushed to a repository – with access limited to the contributors you specify. Easily merge changes you accept.":"让贡献者轻松通知你他们推送到存储库的更改，访问权限仅限于你指定的贡献者。轻松合并你接受的更改。",
"Enforce restrictions on how code branches are merged, including requiring reviews by selected collaborators, or allowing only specific contributors to work on a particular branch.":"限制代码分支的合并方式，包括要求指定协作者审查，或只允许特定贡献者在某个分支上工作。",
"Automatically request reviews – or require approval – by selected contributors when changes are made to sections of code that they own.":"指定贡献者所负责的代码部分发生更改时，自动请求其审查或要求其批准。",
"Easily discuss and collaborate on pull requests before submitting to formal review.":"在提交正式审查前轻松讨论和协作处理拉取请求。",
"Assign more than one person to a pull request.":"为一个拉取请求分配多人。",
"See data about activity and contributions within your repositories, including trends. You can use this data to improve collaboration and make development faster and more effective.":"查看存储库中活动和贡献的数据，包括趋势。你可以利用这些数据改进协作并让开发更快更高效。",
"Send scheduled messages to you or your team listing open pull requests.":"定时向你或你的团队发送包含打开的拉取请求列表的消息。",
"Automatically assign code reviews to members of your team based on one of two algorithms.":"根据两种算法之一自动将代码审查分配给团队成员。",
"When a workflow job references an environment, the job won't start until all of the environment's protection rules pass.":"工作流作业引用环境时，作业须等到该环境的所有保护规则通过后才会开始。",
"When a workflow job references an environment, the job won’t start until all of the environment’s protection rules pass.":"工作流作业引用环境时，作业须等到该环境的所有保护规则通过后才会开始。",
"A job cannot access secrets that are defined in an environment unless it is running on the specified branch.":"作业只有在指定分支上运行时才能访问环境中定义的机密。",
"Invite any GitHub member, or all GitHub members, to work with you on code in a public repository you control – including making changes and opening issues.":"邀请任意或所有 GitHub 成员，与你一起处理你控制的公共存储库中的代码，包括进行更改和创建议题。",
"Invite any GitHub member, or all GitHub members, to work with you on code in a private repository you control – including making changes and opening issues.":"邀请任意或所有 GitHub 成员，与你一起处理你控制的专用存储库中的代码，包括进行更改和创建议题。",
"Track bugs, enhancements, and other requests, prioritize work, and communicate with stakeholders as changes are proposed and merged.":"跟踪缺陷、改进和其他请求，确定工作优先级，并在提出和合并更改时与相关人员沟通。",
"Visualize and manage issues and pull requests across tables, boards, and roadmaps with custom fields and views that you can arrange to suit your workflow.":"在表格、看板和路线图中可视化并管理议题和拉取请求，自定义字段和视图可按你的工作流编排。",
