"The image you selected does not appear to contain your school name. Your complete school name must appear in your document, not only the school logo. You may include multiple documents together. If your official document is not in English then you may photograph the original next to an English translation.":"你选择的图片中似乎没有学校名称。文件中必须出现学校的完整名称，而不仅仅是校徽。你可以将多份文件放在一起。如果你的正式文件不是英文的，可以将原件与英文译本并排拍照。",
"Please ensure that your academic affiliation document contains your first name exactly as it appears in your":"请确保学术证明文件中的名字与你的",
