"Choose which memories Copilot can use in work you start, such as agent sessions and code reviews. If user or repository memory is disabled by organization, enterprise or repository policy, those memories will not be supplied, regardless of your preference. Your preference remains saved and will automatically take effect if the policy later allows memory. Disabling memory does not delete existing memories. While user memories aren't enabled, you can't view or delete them on the Memory page.":"选择 Copilot 在你发起的工作（如智能体会话和代码审查）中可以使用哪些记忆。如果组织、企业或存储库策略禁用了用户记忆或存储库记忆，无论你的偏好如何，都不会提供这些记忆。你的偏好会保留，并在策略日后允许记忆时自动生效。禁用记忆不会删除现有记忆。未启用用户记忆时，你无法在记忆页面查看或删除它们。",
"Choose which memories Copilot can use in work you start, such as agent sessions and code reviews. If user or repository memory is disabled by organization, enterprise or repository policy, those memories will not be supplied, regardless of your preference. Your preference remains saved and will automatically take effect if the policy later allows memory. Disabling memory does not delete existing memories. While user memories aren’t enabled, you can’t view or delete them on the Memory page.":"选择 Copilot 在你发起的工作（如智能体会话和代码审查）中可以使用哪些记忆。如果组织、企业或存储库策略禁用了用户记忆或存储库记忆，无论你的偏好如何，都不会提供这些记忆。你的偏好会保留，并在策略日后允许记忆时自动生效。禁用记忆不会删除现有记忆。未启用用户记忆时，你无法在记忆页面查看或删除它们。",
