"With Copilot coding agent, you can delegate tasks to Copilot, freeing you to focus on the creative, complex, and high-impact work that matters most. Simply assign an issue to Copilot, wait for the agent to request your review, then leave feedback on the pull request to iterate.":"借助 Copilot 编码智能体，你可以将任务委派给 Copilot，从而专注于最重要的创造性、复杂且影响深远的工作。只需将议题分配给 Copilot，等待智能体请求你审查，然后在拉取请求中留下反馈以继续迭代。",
"With Coding agent, you can delegate tasks to Copilot, freeing you to focus on the creative, complex, and high-impact work that matters most. Simply assign an issue to Copilot, wait for the agent to request your review, then leave feedback on the pull request to iterate.":"借助编码智能体，你可以将任务委派给 Copilot，从而专注于最重要的创造性、复杂且影响深远的工作。只需将议题分配给 Copilot，等待智能体请求你审查，然后在拉取请求中留下反馈以继续迭代。",
