"GitHub Enterprise Cloud offers a multi-tenant enterprise SaaS solution on Microsoft Azure, allowing you to choose a regional cloud deployment for data residency, so your in-scope data is stored at rest in a designated location.":"GitHub 企业云在 Microsoft Azure 上提供多租户企业 SaaS 解决方案，你可以选择区域云部署实现数据驻留，让范围内的静态数据存储在指定位置。",
"today or":"或",
"Own and control the user accounts of your enterprise members through your identity provider (IdP).":"通过标识提供者 (IdP) 拥有并控制企业成员的用户帐户。",
"User provisioning through SCIM":"通过 SCIM 预配用户",
"Automatically invite members to join your organization when you grant access on your IdP. If you remove a member's access to your GitHub organization on your SAML IdP, the member will be automatically removed from the GitHub organization.":"在 IdP 上授予访问权限时，自动邀请成员加入你的组织。如果你在 SAML IdP 上删除成员对 GitHub 组织的访问权限，该成员会自动从 GitHub 组织中删除。",
"Enterprise Account to centrally manage multiple organizations":"用企业帐户集中管理多个组织",
"GitHub Enterprise Cloud includes the option to create an enterprise account, which enables collaboration between multiple organizations, gives administrators a single point of visibility and management and brings license cost savings for identical users in multiple organizations.":"GitHub 企业云支持创建企业帐户，便于多个组织协作，为管理员提供统一的查看和管理入口，并为同时属于多个组织的用户节省许可证费用。",
"Environment protection rules":"环境保护规则",
"Enforce branch and tag protections, as well as push rules across your enterprise. Rule insights allow you to assess impact of rules before and during enforcement.":"在整个企业中强制实施分支和标签保护以及推送规则。规则洞察可帮助你在强制实施前和强制实施期间评估规则的影响。",
"Audit Log API":"审核日志 API",
"As a GitHub Enterprise Cloud organization administrator, you can now access log events using our GraphQL API and monitor the activity in your organization.":"作为 GitHub 企业云组织管理员，你可以使用 GraphQL API 访问日志事件并监控组织中的活动。",
"SOC1, SOC2, type 2 reports annually":"每年提供 SOC1、SOC2 Type 2 报告",
"GitHub offers AICPA System and Organization Controls (SOC) 1 Type 2 and SOC 2 Type 2 reports with IAASB International Standards on Assurance Engagements, ISAE 3000, and ISAE 3402.":"GitHub 提供 AICPA 系统与组织控制 (SOC) 1 Type 2 和 SOC 2 Type 2 报告，符合 IAASB 国际鉴证业务准则 ISAE 3000 和 ISAE 3402。",
"FedRAMP Tailored Authority to Operate (ATO)":"FedRAMP Tailored 运营授权 (ATO)",
"Government users can host projects on GitHub Enterprise Cloud with the confidence that our platform meets the low impact software-as-a-service (SaaS) baseline of security standards set by our U.S. federal government partners.":"政府用户可以放心地在 GitHub 企业云上托管项目：平台满足美国联邦政府合作伙伴制定的低影响级软件即服务 (SaaS) 安全标准基线。",
"Use an identity provider to manage the identities of GitHub users and applications.":"使用标识提供者管理 GitHub 用户和应用的身份。",
"Advanced auditing":"高级审核",
"Quickly review the actions performed by members of your organization. Keep copies of audit log data to ensure secure IP and maintain compliance for your organization.":"快速查看组织成员执行的操作。保留审核日志数据副本，以保护知识产权并维持组织合规。",
"Share features and workflows between your GitHub Enterprise Server instance and GitHub Enterprise Cloud.":"在 GitHub 企业服务器实例与 GitHub 企业云之间共享功能和工作流。",
"With Premium, get a 30-minute SLA on Urgent tickets and 24/7 web and phone support via callback request. With Premium Plus, get everything in Premium, assigned Customer Reliability Engineer and more.":"高级支持提供紧急工单 30 分钟 SLA，以及全天候网页和电话回拨支持。高级增强支持包含高级支持的全部内容，另有分配的客户可靠性工程师等服务。",
"Learn more about Premium Support":"了解高级支持",
